The models experienced training for 100 epochs to ensure adequate fitting, utilizing the Adam optimizer [42] with an initial learning rate of 0.1. In this study, there are three key hyperparameters: the dimension of primary capsules, the number of routing iterations, and the dimension of type capsules. We employed grid search and cross-validation techniques to explore these hyperparameters, and the specific search space is detailed in Table S2. We systematically evaluated all possible combinations using five-fold cross-validation to determine the optimal hyperparameters that maximize performance. Accuracy served as our criteria. The training curves of ACP-CapsPred on two datasets are shown in Fig. S1. The pipeline of ACP-CapsPred was implemented using PyTorch [43], and the training procedure was executed across 4 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
