$\times $\end{document} Nvidia 2080 Ti GPUs.

The results of the ablation experiments are presented in Table 6. The predictive model performance is most significantly compromised when the pretrained model is omitted. Particularly, on Set 1, the model without the pretrained model exhibited an accuracy of only 65.52%, representing a decrease of \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
